Panel Edge0
===========

Panel Edge0 is a menu bar app for Mac. It starts, stops and switches Edge0 models.

Copyright 2026 demelos LLC. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see LICENSE).

Panel Edge0 is an independent app. The Edge0 project does not endorse or
sponsor it, and the Edge0 name belongs to its owners.

Panel Edge0 contains no code from Edge0 and has no third-party dependencies. It
uses only Apple system frameworks. At run time, and only when you ask for it,
the app downloads:

  - The Edge0 engine, from the official release at
    https://github.com/Edge0-AI/edge0 (Apache License 2.0, copyright edge0
    contributors; the third-party works bundled with that release are listed in
    its NOTICE file).
  - Edge0 models, from the official Edge0 page on Hugging Face,
    https://huggingface.co/Edge0.

Those downloads keep their own licenses.
